#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
sai2-thumbnailer
Generates thumbnails for Paint Tool SAI 2 (.sai2) files.

Usage:
    sai2-thumbnailer [input_file] [output_file]

Example:
    sai2-thumbnailer artwork.sai2 /tmp/artwork.png

The .sai2 container stores an embedded preview in its "thum" segment using a
compact JPEG variant the app calls "jssf". This script decodes that embedded
preview only. It never touches the artwork layers and never modifies the file.

Credits:
    Format reference derived from the community reverse-engineering of the
    SAI2 container / jssf codec (kagami-meika/sai2-thumbnail-provider and
    Wunkolo/libsai). Thank you.
"""

